              "type": "clause",
              "number": "b",
              "id": "283-2-b",
              "indent": 0,
              "line_start": 17,
              "page_start": 1,
              "page_end": 1,
              "text": "the reference from the jurisdictional Principal Commissioner or Commissioner is made to the Approving Panel under section 274(4).\"",
